    {
      "name": "@xxjxx/artifact-space",
      "title": {
        "en": "Artifact Space",
        "zh": "产物空间"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Adds an Artifact Space entry to the DSH sidebar that lists the final effective artifacts of each session, grouped by workspace and session, with an editor-style preview, image previews, search across workspaces and sessions, favorites, per-file provenance, and an in-panel version check that can download and install a newer release without leaving the panel.",
        "zh": "在 DSH 侧栏新增「产物空间」入口，按工作区与会话分组列出每个会话的最终有效产物，提供编辑器风格预览、图片预览、跨工作区与会话搜索、收藏、逐文件的来源说明，并支持在面板内检测版本、一键下载并安装新版本。"
      },
      "icon": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/majestyjun/artifact-space@main/assets/icon-180.png",
